## versions
cargo 1.100.0 (3acc79c0c 2026-11-05)
rustdoc 1.100.0 (0ef1bc386 2026-11-09)

## A. baseline: a broken intra-doc link, RUSTDOCFLAGS=-Dwarnings in the environment
$ env RUSTDOCFLAGS=-Dwarnings cargo doc --workspace --no-deps --locked
     Documenting member v0.1.0 (outer/repo/member)
    error: unresolved link to `nope`
    -> exit 101
# without the variable
$ cargo doc --workspace --no-deps --locked
       Generated $S/target/doc/doc/member/index.html
     Documenting member v0.1.0 (outer/repo/member)
    warning: `member` (lib doc) generated 1 warning
    warning: unresolved link to `nope`
    -> exit 0

